WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.307
This is the Daily Karma. Today’s practice is ichigo ichie: once, and only now. Find a supported position. Let your eyes close, or rest gently on the painting.

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.684
Settle into a position that can support both ease and alertness. Relax the muscles around your eyes and let the day become quieter.

3
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:07.288
Feel the quiet rhythm of breathing. When the mind moves ahead, come back to one simple inhale and one unhurried exhale.

4
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:35.331
Ichigo ichie comes from the tea room: one meeting, one chance. Even with the same people in the same room, the gathering is new, because nothing has been here twice.

5
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:00.195
A host preparing a bowl of tea as though it were the only one, because for that guest, on that afternoon, in that light, it is.

6
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:29.799
Notice what your body is doing with these words. Soften around the eyes, the hands, and the belly. Keep only the effort needed to stay present.

7
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:57.009
Come back to this breath. Not breathing in general. This one, with whatever mood you brought to it. It is the only version there will be.

8
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:26.495
For a little while, I will be quiet. Let thoughts pass like weather over a wide landscape. When attention wanders, return with patience.

9
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:04.520
Still here. Still breathing. Nothing special needs to happen. This quiet awareness is already a useful way of meeting your life.

10
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:26.334
Treat one ordinary meeting as unrepeatable today. The same colleague. The same walk home. It is the same in name only.

11
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:52.427
Take one fuller breath. Feel the space beyond your body and let your eyes open in their own time. Thank you for practicing with Karma.
